WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.120 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 26=

01:52.840 --> 01:53.440
Your Highness.

01:53.520 --> 01:54.320
(Shunjing Residence)

01:54.400 --> 01:56.320
As expected, Shen Zaiye went
to the crime scene

01:56.680 --> 01:58.240
and I found a broken piece
of a jade pendant.

02:00.120 --> 02:00.960
A broken jade piece?

02:01.360 --> 02:02.040
What kind?

02:06.240 --> 02:07.600
Something about this size.

02:11.080 --> 02:11.680
All right.

02:12.120 --> 02:13.240
Thank you for your hard work.

02:13.320 --> 02:14.880
You should return and get some rest.

02:15.040 --> 02:15.840
Yes, Your Highness.

02:28.840 --> 02:30.400
(When I brought up the broken jade,)

02:31.080 --> 02:33.200
(Prince Wuyin looked a little uneasy.)

02:34.480 --> 02:36.080
(Could that broken jade piece)

02:37.160 --> 02:38.240
(be connected to him?)

03:42.640 --> 03:44.160
(The broken edge matches perfectly)

03:45.320 --> 03:47.480
(with the one from the crime scene.)

03:52.320 --> 03:52.960
Your Highness.

03:54.080 --> 03:54.840
Is that you?

04:03.960 --> 04:04.640
Your Highness.

04:06.840 --> 04:07.760
Are you still awake?

04:14.920 --> 04:16.600
Who dares disturb my rest?

04:23.800 --> 04:26.320
Your Highness, I was passing by

04:26.600 --> 04:28.760
when I heard some noise
from your chamber.

04:28.840 --> 04:29.680
Noise?

04:30.480 --> 04:32.000
I heard nothing.

04:33.080 --> 04:34.440
But thanks to you,

04:35.360 --> 04:36.760
I'm wide awake now.

04:37.720 --> 04:38.720
Calm down, Your Highness.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.240
Please forgive me.

04:42.920 --> 04:43.720
You can leave.

05:19.640 --> 05:21.360
(What does the design)

05:22.320 --> 05:23.640
(on this jade mean?)

05:58.120 --> 05:59.640
(I should give it to him.)

06:01.080 --> 06:02.880
(But I can't let him think)

06:03.240 --> 06:04.200
(I've changed my mind.)

06:10.080 --> 06:13.000
(Chunyue Pavilion)

06:18.320 --> 06:21.640
(Chunyue Pavilion)

06:26.200 --> 06:26.800
Chancellor,

06:26.880 --> 06:28.760
we've questioned everyone in the tavern.

06:28.880 --> 06:29.960
No one has seen this item.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.240
It's a small, broken piece of jade.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.520
Even if they had seen it,

06:34.760 --> 06:36.040
they wouldn't know what it is.

06:48.240 --> 06:49.240
(Qingtai?)

06:52.080 --> 06:52.680
Chancellor.

07:04.600 --> 07:06.760
(Shen Residence)

07:06.840 --> 07:07.440
Chancellor,

07:07.920 --> 07:09.520
do you think Qingtai is acting this way

07:10.280 --> 07:11.960
because the Princess figured
something out,

07:12.040 --> 07:13.560
but didn't want to say it outright?

07:16.200 --> 07:18.400
Zaiye, why are you still standing around

07:18.680 --> 07:19.840
instead of investigating?

07:19.920 --> 07:21.480
Do you want to save Mu Wuxia or not?

07:21.760 --> 07:23.560
Zhan Lu, get someone to send her back.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.840
I don't want to go home.

07:27.040 --> 07:27.640
What's this?

07:27.960 --> 07:29.840
Miss Qingying, be careful.

07:29.920 --> 07:30.920
That may be a clue.

07:31.440 --> 07:32.240
A clue?

07:33.120 --> 07:35.160
It's not a picture or a symbol.

07:35.480 --> 07:37.560
It looks more like some kind of script.

07:45.840 --> 07:46.640
I get it now.

07:47.000 --> 07:47.760
Prepare the horse.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.240
Where are you going? Take me with you.

07:50.320 --> 07:51.880
To seek an audience with His Majesty.

07:53.760 --> 07:56.080
I, Shen Zaiye, request an audience
with His Majesty.

07:57.080 --> 07:57.840
Shen Zaiye,

07:58.480 --> 08:00.680
didn't I tell you to stay out of this?

08:01.080 --> 08:03.000
Are you looking for punishment again?

08:03.120 --> 08:05.480
Your Majesty, I swear on my life

08:05.760 --> 08:07.560
that Prince Wuxia did not kill
Prince Wuhen.

08:07.920 --> 08:09.400
How are you so sure?

08:09.640 --> 08:11.560
Your Majesty, may I be bold to ask

08:12.240 --> 08:14.200
if this year's
imperial examination's essay topic

08:14.280 --> 08:16.960
is "Remonstrate Not the Past.
Let Righteousness Be the Reward"?

08:25.200 --> 08:26.600
How did you know that?

08:30.760 --> 08:32.720
Who dared to leak the question I set?

08:34.000 --> 08:35.000
Find out who did it.

08:35.200 --> 08:37.000
I want this person's
entire family wiped out!

08:37.320 --> 08:37.919
Your Majesty,

08:38.440 --> 08:40.600
I fear this matter is linked
to Prince Wuhen.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.400
Don't spout nonsense!

08:46.560 --> 08:47.200
Your Majesty,

08:47.720 --> 08:49.240
I found a broken jade pendant

08:49.560 --> 08:50.960
at the murder scene,

08:51.480 --> 08:53.760
and the topic was carved on it.

08:54.800 --> 08:55.600
Shen Zaiye,

08:56.440 --> 08:57.200
tell me.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.680
How can you prove

08:59.920 --> 09:01.400
that jade belonged to Wuhen?

09:02.600 --> 09:04.240
He's dead,
and he can't speak for himself.

09:04.320 --> 09:06.080
So don't go making baseless accusations!

09:07.160 --> 09:07.760
Your Majesty,

09:08.400 --> 09:10.360
before Chancellor Meng presided
over the exam,

09:10.840 --> 09:13.480
the Ministry of Rites was dominated
by the Qin family.

09:13.920 --> 09:15.840
If this jade wasn't Prince Wuhen's,

09:16.600 --> 09:17.920
then it must be Prince Wuxia's.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.560
But knowing Prince Wuxia's character,

09:19.880 --> 09:21.320
do you really believe

09:21.640 --> 09:23.560
he would cheat for personal gain?

09:30.240 --> 09:31.080
So

09:31.840 --> 09:34.720
if it belongs to neither of the princes,

09:35.200 --> 09:37.840
then someone else must have been
at the scene.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.520
Please, grant me the authority.

09:43.840 --> 09:46.160
I will uncover the truth.

09:57.200 --> 09:57.800
Granted.

10:00.680 --> 10:06.240
(Discuss. Remonstrate Not the Past.
Let Righteousness Be the Reward.)

10:07.160 --> 10:07.760
Chancellor,

10:07.840 --> 10:09.920
the Princess is staying
at Prince Wuyin's residence.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.800
Now, she still handed over a clue.

10:12.040 --> 10:13.120
Whose side is she on?

10:16.960 --> 10:18.200
Isn't it obvious?

10:19.400 --> 10:22.400
If she's helping me,
she's putting herself in danger.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.600
I need to convince her
to stay out of this.

10:27.720 --> 10:29.120
But she's on guard

10:30.440 --> 10:32.560
around you now.

10:32.840 --> 10:33.840
Will she even listen?

10:34.920 --> 10:35.680
Find Qingtai.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.640
Qingtai.

10:43.640 --> 10:44.400
Qingtai!

10:45.560 --> 10:46.240
Qingtai.

10:52.280 --> 10:53.680
Didn't you say you were busy lately?

10:53.760 --> 10:55.320
How do you still have time to visit me?

10:55.400 --> 10:57.080
Well, I still need to find time, right?

10:57.160 --> 10:58.720
I picked up some snacks along the way.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.680
Oh, Chancellor wants to see you.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.360
Greetings, Chancellor.

11:12.320 --> 11:12.960
Qingtai,

11:13.240 --> 11:15.040
did you go out today?

11:16.720 --> 11:17.480
I didn't.

11:18.400 --> 11:19.120
You didn't?

11:19.640 --> 11:20.680
Then why weren't you around

11:20.760 --> 11:22.360
when the physician came to check on you

11:22.440 --> 11:23.320
during the Si hour?

11:26.440 --> 11:28.200
There was no physician
during the Si hour.

11:32.040 --> 11:33.760
I did go out. So what?

11:34.160 --> 11:34.960
I serve the Princess,

11:35.040 --> 11:36.360
not your prisoner.

11:37.320 --> 11:39.600
So you did meet the Princess.

11:43.800 --> 11:44.600
Did she ask you

11:45.800 --> 11:47.400
to pass me the handkerchief?

11:48.840 --> 11:51.440
(How is he so sharp?)

11:51.520 --> 11:52.880
(He figured it out immediately.)

11:55.360 --> 11:56.400
Let her know

11:56.720 --> 11:58.080
that I am grateful for her help.

11:58.760 --> 12:01.200
I told you the Princess has nothing
to do with this.

12:01.760 --> 12:02.600
Qingtai,

12:02.880 --> 12:03.600
have you considered

12:03.680 --> 12:06.160
that the Princess is risking everything
to help the Chancellor?

12:06.240 --> 12:07.440
She has no one else around her.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.720
If she were discovered,
who is going to protect her?

12:11.200 --> 12:11.840
Qingtai.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.160
I know

12:13.360 --> 12:14.840
you have never thought highly of me.

12:15.520 --> 12:16.640
But for Taohua's sake,

12:17.120 --> 12:19.440
we should set those differences aside.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.280
Qingtai.

12:32.360 --> 12:33.160
(Shunjing Residence)

12:33.240 --> 12:35.360
When you snuck
into Prince Wuyin's residence last time,

12:35.440 --> 12:36.320
I was worried sick.

12:36.440 --> 12:38.000
Have you forgotten what I told you?

12:38.520 --> 12:41.520
You said you will come to me
if there's anything.

12:41.760 --> 12:42.880
So, why didn't you listen?

12:44.240 --> 12:46.040
The Chancellor asked me
to give you a message.

12:48.480 --> 12:49.240
What is it?

12:50.040 --> 12:50.880
He said

12:51.040 --> 12:52.320
you're now in the enemy's den.

12:52.400 --> 12:54.280
The only way
to survive is to stay out of it.

12:54.520 --> 12:56.000
He's telling you to let this go.

12:58.920 --> 13:00.400
Please thank him for his concern.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.800
But I'm not doing this for him.

13:04.080 --> 13:05.440
But to save Prince Wuxia.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.000
Your Highness,

13:07.720 --> 13:09.680
I've been staying there for a while now.

13:09.960 --> 13:12.000
I don't think he's a bad man.

13:12.240 --> 13:13.640
The day you fell off that cliff,

13:13.800 --> 13:15.680
he was trying to save both you
and Prince Wuxia.

13:15.760 --> 13:17.320
That's why he acted as he did.

13:18.680 --> 13:19.440
Your Highness,

13:19.720 --> 13:21.680
why won't you make peace with him?

13:24.240 --> 13:25.000
Qingtai.

13:26.280 --> 13:27.160
The truth is,

13:28.440 --> 13:29.640
I've remembered everything.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.080
Your Highness, you…

13:31.200 --> 13:32.440
Don't tell anyone.

13:33.400 --> 13:34.400
In front of him,

13:34.720 --> 13:36.720
don't let him see even
the slightest sign.

13:39.520 --> 13:40.520
But

13:40.760 --> 13:42.040
how do you

13:42.880 --> 13:44.400
truly feel about him?

13:45.160 --> 13:47.320
You may act indifferent on the surface.

13:47.400 --> 13:49.000
But I know your heart still holds him.

13:49.480 --> 13:51.800
He may speak harshly.

13:52.240 --> 13:54.160
But he clearly still cares for you.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.240
If you miss each other,

13:56.440 --> 13:57.920
why do you keep hurting each other?

14:01.080 --> 14:02.560
Shen Zaiye and I were never meant

14:03.000 --> 14:04.120
to stand on the same side.

14:05.200 --> 14:08.200
He didn't know my background before,

14:08.640 --> 14:10.480
and we were forced
to live under the same roof

14:10.680 --> 14:11.800
while walking on eggshells.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.760
Now

14:14.680 --> 14:16.400
that he knows I'm a spy.

14:17.400 --> 14:18.760
We're serving different masters.

14:19.720 --> 14:21.520
So, how could love ever survive?

14:23.600 --> 14:24.920
Since I've already left,

14:25.920 --> 14:27.400
it's best we both move on in peace.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.040
Your Highness,

15:00.840 --> 15:02.200
I only worry

15:02.280 --> 15:03.360
that you might be giving up

15:03.440 --> 15:05.200
something precious.

15:10.400 --> 15:11.040
What about you?

15:11.520 --> 15:12.440
How's your injury?

15:12.680 --> 15:13.400
Show me.

15:13.640 --> 15:15.480
I've recovered. So don't worry.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.160
Qingtai.

15:21.400 --> 15:22.560
There's something

15:23.280 --> 15:24.840
I've been thinking about for a while.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.680
Now that you've recovered.

15:29.440 --> 15:30.800
So I think it's time.

15:31.320 --> 15:33.440
I can come back to protect you
whenever you need me.

15:34.320 --> 15:35.080
I know that.

15:36.120 --> 15:36.920
But

15:38.320 --> 15:39.840
I want you to leave Qi.

15:42.040 --> 15:42.840
Your Highness,

15:43.640 --> 15:44.760
don't you want me anymore?

15:45.520 --> 15:46.920
Though we are master and servant,

15:47.160 --> 15:48.080
I have long regarded you

15:48.160 --> 15:49.120
as my younger sister.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.480
So, how could I not want you?

15:52.560 --> 15:53.240
Your Highness,

15:54.760 --> 15:56.400
since the day we met,

15:56.720 --> 15:57.680
I vowed

15:58.280 --> 16:00.400
to protect you.

16:09.680 --> 16:10.880
You are…

16:16.320 --> 16:17.440
That flower is not edible.

16:17.520 --> 16:18.600
It'll upset your stomach.

16:19.920 --> 16:21.880
Taohua, Master is here!

16:24.520 --> 16:26.800
I originally saved this for Changjue.
But you can have it.

16:29.080 --> 16:30.120
This is for you.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.120
Master!

16:35.120 --> 16:36.240
What brings you here?

16:36.600 --> 16:37.240
Your Highness,

16:37.720 --> 16:38.880
you and the Prince need

16:39.200 --> 16:40.600
someone trustworthy by your side.

16:41.360 --> 16:43.600
So I've found a young maid for you.

16:43.840 --> 16:44.840
She's loyal

16:45.160 --> 16:46.360
and skilled in self-defense.

16:46.960 --> 16:47.560
From now on,

16:48.160 --> 16:49.920
she'll serve both of you.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.200
Qingtai.

16:54.400 --> 16:55.200
Oh, it's you.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.600
I, Qingtai, greet Your Highness.

16:57.960 --> 16:59.840
I will protect Your Highness
with all my life

17:00.080 --> 17:01.920
and won't let you suffer.

17:03.400 --> 17:04.400
You're the only family

17:04.720 --> 17:06.319
I have left in this world.

17:07.359 --> 17:08.319
Can you

17:09.280 --> 17:10.680
please not leave me?

17:12.160 --> 17:13.760
I would never leave you.

17:15.400 --> 17:16.319
Now,

17:16.960 --> 17:19.000
I've gained Prince Wuyin's trust.

17:19.359 --> 17:21.920
I need to stay and find the antidote.

17:22.400 --> 17:24.319
I wanted you to go
and find Changjue for me.

17:25.560 --> 17:27.079
You want me to find His Highness?

17:30.960 --> 17:33.080
Empress Lv was watching

17:33.360 --> 17:34.880
our every move.

17:35.280 --> 17:37.480
One mistake would implicate Changjue.

17:38.440 --> 17:40.240
But now you've escaped death

17:40.520 --> 17:42.160
and you're finally out of her grasp.

17:42.640 --> 17:45.280
Only you can go and find him now.

17:45.800 --> 17:46.960
You're the only one I trust.

17:48.080 --> 17:49.720
Once you find Changjue,

17:50.600 --> 17:52.200
we'll leave this place behind

17:52.800 --> 17:54.360
and find a quiet place.

17:54.960 --> 17:57.080
No more a life of hardship
and wandering.

17:58.560 --> 18:00.200
As long as I'm with you,

18:00.440 --> 18:01.920
I'm willing to do anything.

18:02.600 --> 18:03.640
But

18:03.920 --> 18:05.880
where do I begin searching
for His Highness?

18:10.280 --> 18:12.720
Changjue once wrote in a letter

18:13.840 --> 18:17.160
that his camp is near a desert.

18:18.080 --> 18:19.080
I believe

18:19.320 --> 18:21.640
it's somewhere
in the northern frontier near Xingzhou.

18:22.160 --> 18:24.240
All right.
I'll set out tomorrow morning.

18:26.040 --> 18:27.400
Qian Mochen once said

18:28.000 --> 18:30.440
that the Xingzhou frontier is a land
of endless sand

18:30.600 --> 18:31.720
and few people.

18:32.800 --> 18:33.880
The camp must be located

18:34.160 --> 18:35.880
in a remote corner somewhere.

18:37.520 --> 18:40.880
It won't be easy searching for Changjue.

18:41.040 --> 18:43.520
Even if I have to turn over
every grain of sand in Xingzhou,

18:43.640 --> 18:45.160
I'll find Prince Changjue.

18:47.480 --> 18:48.480
Then promise me

18:48.920 --> 18:50.200
not to be reckless

18:50.440 --> 18:51.360
and stay safe.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.440
Don't worry, Your Highness.

18:53.560 --> 18:55.520
I'll keep both myself
and His Highness safe.

18:59.320 --> 18:59.960
One more thing,

19:00.560 --> 19:03.240
don't let Shen Zaiye know.

19:50.200 --> 19:55.160
(Shen Residence)

19:58.480 --> 19:59.880
Why is Qingtai still not back?

20:02.560 --> 20:03.960
Chancellor, you've had a long day.

20:04.040 --> 20:04.880
Please get some rest.

20:04.960 --> 20:05.920
I'll wait for her here.

20:14.160 --> 20:15.120
Qingtai, what's wrong?

20:15.640 --> 20:16.360
Did you cry?

20:19.200 --> 20:21.480
Thank you for taking me in
during this time, Chancellor.

20:21.960 --> 20:23.600
Her Highness has granted me my freedom.

20:24.000 --> 20:26.240
Tomorrow, I'll set out for Beiyuan
to search for my kin.

20:26.480 --> 20:27.800
You're a busy man, Chancellor.

20:28.080 --> 20:29.880
So I won't trouble you with goodbyes.

20:31.440 --> 20:32.160
You're leaving?

20:46.320 --> 20:47.000
Zhan Lu.

20:49.760 --> 20:51.120
If you wish to go with her,

20:51.840 --> 20:52.640
I won't stop you.

20:56.320 --> 20:57.000
I'm staying.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.200
Then don't

21:00.800 --> 21:01.800
regret it.

21:04.080 --> 21:04.880
I won't regret it.

21:08.720 --> 21:09.440
Chancellor,

21:09.920 --> 21:12.000
what do you think
the Princess is really thinking?

21:14.120 --> 21:16.920
She wants to sever all ties with me.

21:19.280 --> 21:20.520
Perhaps that's for the best.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.080
At least,

21:22.600 --> 21:23.920
she's finally out of this mess.

21:28.280 --> 21:28.960
Send word

21:29.040 --> 21:30.880
to search the entire city
for jade engravers.

21:31.280 --> 21:32.440
Make sure it causes a stir.

21:33.240 --> 21:33.880
And remember,

21:34.480 --> 21:36.960
the jade clue didn't come
from Jiang Taohua

21:37.640 --> 21:39.480
but from the craftsmen.

21:41.520 --> 21:42.200
Chancellor,

21:42.760 --> 21:43.960
why go to such lengths

21:44.280 --> 21:45.320
for the Princess?

21:59.840 --> 22:02.640
(Shunjing Residence)

22:02.720 --> 22:04.040
The month is nearly up.

22:04.560 --> 22:06.680
I've come to ask for the antidote.

22:07.840 --> 22:08.920
I heard Chancellor Shen

22:09.200 --> 22:10.800
is searching the city

22:11.280 --> 22:12.240
for jade carvers.

22:13.800 --> 22:15.680
He's trying to clear Mu Wuxia's name.

22:16.840 --> 22:18.680
But I will not allow that to happen.

22:21.920 --> 22:22.800
I can give

22:22.880 --> 22:24.040
the antidote to you anytime.

22:24.640 --> 22:25.240
But not

22:25.800 --> 22:26.680
without a price.

22:28.480 --> 22:29.520
Miss Meng,

22:30.160 --> 22:31.880
you know what you have to do.

22:32.560 --> 22:34.600
Last time I got involved
through Xiang Qingying.

22:35.160 --> 22:36.960
Chancellor Shen didn't suspect a thing.

22:37.760 --> 22:39.040
If you don't mind,

22:39.640 --> 22:41.600
I'm willing to serve again.

22:42.800 --> 22:43.400
Then go.

22:44.800 --> 22:47.480
Word is he's at the jade workshop
in the south of the city.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.160
Yes, Your Highness.

23:08.760 --> 23:09.440
(Shen Zaiye,)

23:09.720 --> 23:11.240
(when the woman you love brings pain)

23:11.320 --> 23:13.360
(that cuts to the bone
and pierces the heart,)

23:13.440 --> 23:14.920
(can you still stand your ground?)

23:17.680 --> 23:20.000
(Jade Workshop)

23:20.360 --> 23:21.960
Chancellor, the Princess is here.

23:23.720 --> 23:24.640
Miss Meng, it looks like

23:24.720 --> 23:27.160
you still don't understand
what "staying out of it" means.

23:28.200 --> 23:30.200
I'm only here to help
Prince Wuxia clear his name.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.800
In that case,

23:36.200 --> 23:37.480
why don't we split up the work?

23:37.560 --> 23:38.960
That way, we can save some time.

23:43.440 --> 23:45.760
Do you know
why I brought you in for questioning?

23:46.160 --> 23:46.840
No.

23:49.520 --> 23:52.320
Was Prince Wuhen a regular here?

23:52.600 --> 23:55.080
He liked the food here.

23:55.280 --> 23:56.520
He booked the same private room

23:56.600 --> 23:58.680
and spent all year drinking
and enjoying himself here.

23:58.760 --> 24:00.840
He spent all year drinking
and enjoying himself.

24:00.960 --> 24:03.240
And in all that time,
only you served him?

24:03.600 --> 24:07.400
I suppose he found me pleasing.

24:08.160 --> 24:09.920
A beauty like you

24:10.280 --> 24:12.160
is hard for any man to resist.

24:13.440 --> 24:14.320
But

24:14.720 --> 24:15.840
I noticed something strange.

24:15.920 --> 24:18.360
(Braised Soft-Shelled Turtle
and Lamb with Pickled Amaranth)

24:18.440 --> 24:19.760
See here, in the account book.

24:19.840 --> 24:21.640
Recently,
these two dishes kept showing up.

24:21.720 --> 24:24.160
Braised soft-shelled turtle and lamb
with pickled amaranth.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.320
Soft-shelled turtle and amaranth
don't go together,

24:26.480 --> 24:28.000
as they can cause stomach problems.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.320
That's odd

24:30.120 --> 24:31.160
because no customers

24:31.840 --> 24:33.000
ever got sick.

24:35.360 --> 24:36.440
The employee says

24:37.000 --> 24:38.840
every time someone ordered
those two dishes,

24:39.400 --> 24:40.560
(Testimony)
you were the one

24:40.760 --> 24:41.720
who served them.

24:42.160 --> 24:44.360
Then the dancer would take
the guest away.

24:44.600 --> 24:45.920
And it just so happened,

24:46.680 --> 24:48.480
after Prince Wuxia left that night,

24:49.160 --> 24:50.800
someone else ordered
the same two dishes.

24:52.160 --> 24:53.280
As expected,

24:54.040 --> 24:55.240
you took this person away.

24:55.560 --> 24:57.120
Aiding in leaking the exam

24:57.520 --> 24:59.200
could get your entire clan executed.

25:00.000 --> 25:02.600
If you tell me
who Prince Wuhen met that night,

25:03.560 --> 25:04.680
I'll spare your life.

25:05.320 --> 25:06.440
If I were you,

25:06.720 --> 25:07.960
I would tell everything I know

25:08.360 --> 25:10.920
to save my family

25:11.600 --> 25:14.080
since the matter has been exposed.

25:16.800 --> 25:17.680
I'll talk.

25:18.680 --> 25:19.720
-Meng Huairui?
-Meng Huairui?

25:20.880 --> 25:22.960
Zhan Lu, take Meng Huairui in now!

25:23.680 --> 25:24.280
Yes, sir.

25:32.840 --> 25:33.520
Zhenzhen?

25:33.960 --> 25:35.200
You came alone?

25:35.880 --> 25:37.280
Why didn't you bring your maid?

25:38.320 --> 25:39.880
Are you going somewhere?

25:41.320 --> 25:43.200
My uncle is gravely ill.

25:43.280 --> 25:45.080
My mother's family wrote
to ask me to visit.

25:46.840 --> 25:49.960
So, have your parents left?

25:50.360 --> 25:51.080
Zhenzhen,

25:51.160 --> 25:52.360
I'm in a rush.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.760
If you'll excuse me, I have…

25:53.840 --> 25:54.440
Of course.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.440
Huairui…

25:59.680 --> 26:00.320
Father.

26:01.040 --> 26:01.720
Mother.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.200
I didn't kill him.

26:09.240 --> 26:10.480
I only gave him a little push.

26:10.680 --> 26:12.600
Prince Wuhen hit his head and died.

26:14.760 --> 26:15.400
That day,

26:15.840 --> 26:18.160
I went to Chunyue Pavilion
to buy the exam questions.

26:18.640 --> 26:19.520
But before I arrived,

26:19.800 --> 26:21.240
Prince Wuxia and Prince Wuhen

26:21.320 --> 26:22.160
had a huge fight.

26:23.040 --> 26:25.160
Prince Wuhen took it out on me.

26:25.680 --> 26:26.280
Your Highness,

26:26.480 --> 26:27.600
someone is here to see you.

26:37.480 --> 26:39.640
Meng Huairui, at your service.

26:40.760 --> 26:41.760
The Meng family, huh?

26:43.560 --> 26:45.480
Do you think
anyone can just walk in here?

26:49.760 --> 26:50.520
Prince Wuhen,

26:53.400 --> 26:54.640
don't be so quick

26:55.400 --> 26:56.760
to turn down business.

26:59.440 --> 27:01.640
Plenty of nobles have come before me.

27:02.000 --> 27:03.560
There has never been an issue.

27:04.400 --> 27:06.840
Today, you and Wuxia came one
after another.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.960
Don't tell me
this is all just a coincidence!

27:12.120 --> 27:14.240
It truly has nothing to do with me.

27:15.080 --> 27:16.880
I only came to purchase a jade pendant.

27:21.600 --> 27:23.680
The Mengs are always full of schemes.

27:24.160 --> 27:24.760
Get lost!

27:28.160 --> 27:28.880
Prince Wuhen,

27:29.800 --> 27:32.000
I know that jade pendant
is the exam topic,

27:32.080 --> 27:34.280
and I know you've already sold it
to more than a few.

27:35.040 --> 27:35.640
You…

27:36.240 --> 27:37.880
You will sell it even
if you don't want to!

27:37.960 --> 27:39.720
Let's see what you can bargain with now!

27:54.920 --> 27:55.520
Prince Wuhen…

27:55.880 --> 27:56.560
Prince Wuhen…

28:29.840 --> 28:30.600
Zhenzhen.

28:31.880 --> 28:32.640
Ms. Zhenzhen,

28:33.120 --> 28:35.000
I swear I'm telling the truth.

28:35.440 --> 28:36.720
All I did was push him.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.960
I didn't know he was that weak.

28:39.760 --> 28:40.360
I…

28:41.920 --> 28:42.560
Ms. Zhenzhen,

28:44.520 --> 28:46.000
even if I've committed such vile

28:46.080 --> 28:47.200
and heartless deeds,

28:48.200 --> 28:49.520
you know I'm a devoted son.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.840
My parents are in your hands.

28:52.120 --> 28:53.880
So, how could I lie to you?

28:54.680 --> 28:55.760
I swear to heaven.

28:56.920 --> 28:58.600
If I'm lying,

28:58.880 --> 28:59.480
I will…

29:00.480 --> 29:02.320
Let me and my parents meet
a terrible end.

29:03.160 --> 29:05.000
Shen Zaiye is investigating
this himself.

29:05.760 --> 29:07.200
If it leads back to you,

29:08.720 --> 29:10.680
have you thought
about what to answer him?

29:12.600 --> 29:13.280
I…

29:14.960 --> 29:16.200
I'll tell the truth

29:16.760 --> 29:17.840
and leave it to fate.

29:21.640 --> 29:24.200
Ms. Zhenzhen, blame me if you must.

29:24.520 --> 29:25.880
But please spare my parents.

29:26.080 --> 29:26.880
Ms. Zhenzhen.

29:26.960 --> 29:28.120
I ask you one more time.

29:28.960 --> 29:30.760
If it leads back to you,

29:31.720 --> 29:34.000
what will you answer?

29:36.360 --> 29:36.960
I…

29:40.600 --> 29:41.640
Ms. Zhenzhen,

29:42.040 --> 29:44.080
I will answer
however you want me to answer.

29:44.560 --> 29:45.720
Let my parents go.

29:45.800 --> 29:46.720
Please…

29:48.080 --> 29:49.000
Ms. Zhenzhen.

29:49.200 --> 29:49.800
Ms. Zhenzhen.

29:51.440 --> 29:52.800
As long as we catch Meng Huairui,

29:53.160 --> 29:54.200
we can save Prince Wuxia.

29:55.280 --> 29:55.920
That's right.

29:57.160 --> 29:58.240
There are still two details

29:58.720 --> 29:59.720
that are suspicious.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.360
What details?

30:02.000 --> 30:02.960
First,

30:03.200 --> 30:05.720
the two bloodstains at the corner
of the table don't line up.

30:08.720 --> 30:09.680
We need to confirm

30:10.120 --> 30:11.760
whether the shape
of Prince Wuhen's wound

30:11.920 --> 30:13.560
matches the ones on the table.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.160
And the second?

30:17.360 --> 30:18.360
Have you seen

30:18.440 --> 30:19.760
anything shaped like a lotus?

30:20.040 --> 30:20.800
A lotus?

30:21.560 --> 30:22.960
I once saw a lotus-shaped carving

30:23.040 --> 30:24.520
on the window ledge.

30:24.600 --> 30:25.840
It's about two inches wide.

30:35.040 --> 30:35.880
Are you all right?

30:36.720 --> 30:37.400
Chancellor Shen,

30:38.040 --> 30:38.960
I need to return now.

30:39.320 --> 30:40.040
Please excuse me.

30:40.560 --> 30:41.360
Miss Meng.

30:44.080 --> 30:44.800
Jiang Taohua.

30:45.200 --> 30:45.800
Jiang Taohua.

30:50.440 --> 30:53.120
(The peach blossom mark is the sign
that the poison is activating.)

30:53.240 --> 30:55.040
(If we don't take the antidote
every month,)

30:55.760 --> 30:57.720
(we'll start with blood vomiting
and fainting.)

30:57.800 --> 30:59.840
(Then comes sudden death.)

31:00.880 --> 31:02.320
Someone! Get the carriage ready!

31:09.680 --> 31:11.960
(Shunjing Residence)

31:12.040 --> 31:13.840
So it turns out Wuhen died by accident.

31:15.920 --> 31:18.160
That day, Prince Wuxia went
to confront him

31:18.680 --> 31:20.120
about the leaked exam questions.

31:20.640 --> 31:21.960
Meng Huairui and Prince Wuhen

31:22.040 --> 31:23.560
had a dispute over it afterward

31:24.280 --> 31:25.600
that led to the tragedy.

31:27.600 --> 31:29.280
I've warned Wuhen before

31:30.040 --> 31:32.320
to stop fooling around

31:32.600 --> 31:33.960
and strengthen his body.

31:34.840 --> 31:35.520
Or else

31:35.640 --> 31:37.480
he wouldn't have died such
a miserable death.

31:37.600 --> 31:38.200
Your Highness,

31:38.560 --> 31:40.080
our spies at the jade workshop report

31:40.760 --> 31:42.400
that Miss Meng has collapsed
from poison.

31:47.520 --> 31:49.240
She's just a pawn gone bad.

31:49.840 --> 31:50.480
It's nothing.

31:51.040 --> 31:51.880
Please continue.

31:53.120 --> 31:53.800
Your Highness,

31:54.320 --> 31:56.800
Shen Zaiye is still combing the city
for jade craftsmen.

31:57.520 --> 31:59.200
I'm worried
he'll trace the craftsman back

31:59.480 --> 32:00.800
to our Meng family.

32:01.000 --> 32:01.600
Oh, right.

32:02.400 --> 32:04.360
The craftsman came from your family.

32:04.840 --> 32:07.120
So is Meng Huairui.

32:07.640 --> 32:08.520
I guess

32:08.840 --> 32:11.120
Meng Huairui joined hands with Wuhen

32:11.600 --> 32:13.400
for fame and fortune.

32:13.960 --> 32:16.440
In the end, things went sideways,
and they argued.

32:16.720 --> 32:17.760
Then someone died.

32:17.880 --> 32:19.480
And what does that have to do with us?

32:21.200 --> 32:22.800
The real question is,

32:22.920 --> 32:24.720
will you be willing
to sacrifice a clansman?

32:25.320 --> 32:27.080
That Meng Huairui deserves
what's coming.

32:27.480 --> 32:29.000
What worries me now

32:29.600 --> 32:31.440
is Shen Zaiye using this matter

32:31.640 --> 32:32.960
to trace it further

32:33.680 --> 32:34.680
and expose more secrets.

32:35.680 --> 32:36.720
If he does,

32:37.680 --> 32:38.960
we weigh the cost.

32:39.880 --> 32:41.600
He's placing his next move on my piece.

32:42.040 --> 32:42.880
Why should you fear?

32:53.440 --> 32:54.560
(Yiyun Residence)

32:54.640 --> 32:55.240
Someone!

32:55.320 --> 32:56.600
Imperial Physician Bai, save her!

32:57.120 --> 32:57.920
Chancellor, this way.

32:58.000 --> 33:00.200
Imperial Physician Bai,
how's the antidote coming along?

33:00.280 --> 33:01.960
Chancellor, it's still in development.

33:02.360 --> 33:03.880
For now,

33:04.040 --> 33:06.320
I can only prescribe
a pain-relieving powder

33:06.480 --> 33:07.520
to ease her symptoms.

33:07.600 --> 33:08.440
All right.

33:08.680 --> 33:09.400
Follow me.

33:19.080 --> 33:19.680
Chancellor,

33:19.760 --> 33:21.280
Meng Huairui's residence was ransacked,

33:21.360 --> 33:22.480
and he's nowhere to be found.

33:22.560 --> 33:24.040
Also, Meng Zhenzhen wants to see you.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.760
She said you'll regret it if you refuse.

33:26.680 --> 33:29.000
If anything happens to Taohua,
report to me immediately.

33:29.080 --> 33:29.680
Yes. sir.

33:31.880 --> 33:32.680
Get to the point.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.480
Why are you here?

33:35.960 --> 33:36.800
It's been a while.

33:41.920 --> 33:42.720
I'm here

33:43.160 --> 33:44.480
to make you a deal.

33:45.360 --> 33:46.160
For Meng Huairui?

33:47.280 --> 33:49.160
Catching him is only a matter of time.

33:49.760 --> 33:51.760
The Meng family is willing
to hand him over

33:52.080 --> 33:53.480
and do whatever you want with him.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.480
But this matter ends there.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.360
You must not drag
the Meng family into it.

33:57.440 --> 33:58.600
Why would I agree to that?

33:58.840 --> 34:00.200
Because of Jiang Taohua's life.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.600
I hear she's been poisoned.

34:05.320 --> 34:08.040
She must be in terrible pain by now.

34:10.080 --> 34:11.320
So the Meng family has sided

34:11.760 --> 34:13.120
with Prince Wuyin.

34:14.719 --> 34:15.800
No need for small talk.

34:17.480 --> 34:18.440
Do you want

34:18.960 --> 34:20.320
the antidote or not?

34:22.760 --> 34:24.040
Whether it's destroyed or not

34:24.719 --> 34:26.360
depends entirely on you.

34:30.280 --> 34:31.280
How do I know

34:31.600 --> 34:33.040
this antidote is even real?

34:33.560 --> 34:34.880
How do you want me to prove it?

34:35.159 --> 34:35.760
Test it.

34:36.480 --> 34:37.960
If anything happens to Jiang Taohua,

34:38.280 --> 34:39.400
I'll hold you responsible.

35:51.080 --> 35:52.040
The antidote works.

35:52.680 --> 35:54.320
Then I'll hand over Meng Huairui to you.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.320
What I want isn't just a temporary fix

35:57.600 --> 35:58.800
but the permanent cure.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.080
Give me the permanent cure.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.640
Then I'll let your family go.

36:03.200 --> 36:04.200
You should've said that

36:04.360 --> 36:05.840
before we tested the medicine.

36:06.120 --> 36:06.720
You're the one

36:07.600 --> 36:08.800
who came to make a deal.

36:09.800 --> 36:11.600
I never agreed to anything.

36:13.640 --> 36:14.480
Let me be honest.

36:14.880 --> 36:16.200
I don't have the permanent cure.

36:16.960 --> 36:18.280
All I have are these two pills.

36:18.960 --> 36:19.880
If you want them,

36:20.600 --> 36:21.760
I'll give them both.

36:22.600 --> 36:23.560
If not,

36:24.440 --> 36:25.800
next time the poison flares up,

36:26.560 --> 36:28.000
she might not be so lucky.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.720
Leave the antidote.

36:38.400 --> 36:40.640
I want Meng Huairui taken alive
to the imperial prison.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.200
This time,

36:42.800 --> 36:44.080
I'll let the Meng family go.

36:49.440 --> 36:50.880
You have my word, Chancellor Shen.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.040
I'll take care of it.

37:04.960 --> 37:05.560
Zhan Lu.

37:05.640 --> 37:06.240
Yes, sir.

37:06.320 --> 37:07.920
Give the pills
to Imperial Physician Bai.

37:08.000 --> 37:10.080
Have him work on developing
the full cure immediately.

37:10.160 --> 37:10.760
Yes, sir.

37:11.880 --> 37:13.840
(He actually gave in for me.)

37:14.040 --> 37:16.280
(Just like that,
he let the Meng family off the hook.)

37:22.040 --> 37:22.960
Imperial Physician Bai

37:23.360 --> 37:24.960
will work on the permanent cure.

37:25.520 --> 37:26.880
You can rest here without worry.

37:28.680 --> 37:29.280
Chancellor.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.280
These will last for two months.

37:42.680 --> 37:44.600
Thank you for the medicine,
Chancellor Shen.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.760
I must return
to Prince Wuyin's residence now.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.360
Very well.

38:17.800 --> 38:19.080
(That lotus-shaped mark…)

38:21.040 --> 38:22.640
(Why do Jiang Taohua's
shoe prints match)

38:22.720 --> 38:24.160
(with the ones at the crime scene?)

38:25.120 --> 38:25.880
(Or could it be)

38:26.320 --> 38:28.320
(that everyone
at Prince Wuyin's residence)

38:28.600 --> 38:29.880
(wears the same kind of shoes?)

38:49.160 --> 38:52.360
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

38:52.440 --> 38:55.480
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

38:56.400 --> 38:59.520
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

38:59.640 --> 39:03.400
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

39:03.680 --> 39:06.760
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

39:06.880 --> 39:10.200
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

39:10.600 --> 39:14.160
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

39:14.240 --> 39:19.960
♪With no one it can be brought♪

39:24.920 --> 39:31.840
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

39:32.280 --> 39:39.120
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

39:39.600 --> 39:46.600
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

39:46.920 --> 39:50.960
♪Even if it means this flower♪

39:51.080 --> 39:58.040
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

40:09.160 --> 40:12.280
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

40:12.360 --> 40:15.600
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

40:15.960 --> 40:19.640
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

40:19.760 --> 40:26.320
♪No longer needing to say♪

40:30.400 --> 40:37.320
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

40:37.720 --> 40:44.680
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

40:45.040 --> 40:52.040
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

40:52.400 --> 40:54.080
♪And finding♪

40:54.160 --> 41:01.160
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
